{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6c6bb8c4-a5d5-8f6f-9d7e-cc1064b630c7",
  "created_at": "2026-01-12T10:05:15-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Tariq Abdi",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:02:47-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, good morning. I'm calling about a storm drain on the corner by my place, 27 Malbone Road, up in the North End. Basically it's full to the top and it's not draining at all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:03:01-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is this since the storm over the weekend?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:03:05-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, the coastal one Friday into Saturday. That was two days ago and the water's still just sitting there. Basically a pond at the corner. It hasn't gone down one inch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:03:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Is the water up in the street, or is it getting toward any houses?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:03:20-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Street and the edge of the sidewalk. Not in my place, no. But cars are driving through it and throwing it everywhere, and walking past it is a pain. I took a bunch of photos, actually. Happy to send them if that helps."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:03:34-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That would help. I can give you where to send those in a second. Is the grate itself clear, or is it blocked with leaves and debris?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:03:43-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Basically it's packed with leaves and some trash on top, but even the part you can see is just full of water. Like, brim full. So I think it's backed up further down, not only the grate."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Could be. Either way a crew will want to look at it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Quick question, is that a city drain or a state one? Malbone's kind of a bigger road, so I wasn't sure who to even call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:09-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. From what you're describing, a corner drain like that is usually ours, but if it turns out to be on a state road they'll hand it off. Either way you're in the right place and I'll put in the request."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:23-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I just don't want it bouncing around for a week. I've got a friend visiting from Canada next month and I'd like the corner not to be a lake by then."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Let me get a callback number in case someone needs to reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0175."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:41-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0175. And the corner is Malbone and which cross street?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:46-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Uh, basically the nearest corner to 27, it's just the one at the end of my block. The photos will show it. Where do I send those?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:04:55-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll text you the address for the Public Works inbox right after we hang up. Attach the photos and put your street in the subject line."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, works for me. Thanks."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:06-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Crews are working through a pile of drain calls from the weekend, so you should see someone this week."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-12T10:05:13-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Thanks, bye."
    }
  ],
